## Verification checklist (MANDATORY before "done")

Agent 2 must run these and **paste actual output** in chat. If any check fails, status is **NOT COMPLETE**.

### Check 1 — Files exist in git (not just described)

```bash
cd openclaw-saas
test -f artifacts/api-server/corpus/legal-corpus-manifest.json && echo "manifest OK" || echo "FAIL: no manifest"
find artifacts/api-server/corpus/sources -type f | wc -l    # expect >= 50
test -f scripts/ingest-legal-corpus/src/main.ts && echo "CLI OK" || echo "FAIL: no CLI"
test -f artifacts/api-server/src/lib/legalCorpus/ingestBatch.ts && echo "ingestBatch OK" || echo "FAIL"
test -f artifacts/api-server/src/lib/legalCorpus/rrfMerge.ts && echo "rrfMerge OK" || echo "FAIL"
git log -1 --oneline   # must show YOUR commit, not only plan docs
```

**Fail example:** Agent claims "59 manifest entries" but `find corpus/sources | wc -l` is 0 → **FICTION**.

### Check 2 — k30t corpus grew (not local-only)

```bash
curl -s https://openclaw-api-k30t.onrender.com/api/v1/legal/kb/status
```

| Field | Required after ingest | Current baseline (2026-06-06) |
|-------|----------------------|----------------------------------|
| `documents` | **≥ 40** | 12 |
| `chunks` | **≥ 200** | 12 |
| `by_source.statute` | **≥ 3** | not in API yet — add in D3 |
| `by_source.cuad` | **≥ 50** | not in API yet |

If k30t still shows `documents: 12, chunks: 12` → **ingest never ran on prod DB**.

### Check 3 — Statute text is primary source (not summary-only)

```bash
curl -s -X POST https://openclaw-api-k30t.onrender.com/api/v1/legal/kb/search \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"query":"DGCL section 144 restricted securities safe harbor","limit":3}' \
  | jq '.hits[].slug, .hits[].excerpt[:120]'
```

Must return a slug like `dgcl-144-statute` with **statutory prose**, not a 3-paragraph playbook summary.

### Check 4 — Tests exist and pass

```bash
cd artifacts/api-server && pnpm test legalCorpus
```

No test file = not done.

### Check 5 — Idempotent re-ingest

Run ingest twice; second run must report **0 new chunks** (same `source_hash`).

